{"id":"n73258-2-5","stage":1,"title":"열흘 · 初十","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73258-2-5-1","ko":"우리 계 모임이 언제였더라?","zh":"我们的互助会什么时候聚会来着？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계","meaning":"契，互助会","explanation":"계：契，互助会","readings":[{"term":"계","audio":"/audio/e5fc8350e1fcc9ef8a9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92529","senseId":"1","lemma":"계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모임이","meaning":"聚会","explanation":"모임：聚会；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"모임","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61519","senseId":"1","lemma":"모임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제였더라?","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"e5fc8350e1fcc9ef","term":"계","zh":"契，互助会","audio":"/audio/e5fc8350e1fcc9ef8a9f.mp3","entryId":"92529","definition":"从古至今为了在经济上互相帮助或增进和睦而建立的组织。","pronunciation":["계:","게:"]},{"id":"2485fc53da01e9d6","term":"모임","zh":"聚会","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3","entryId":"61519","definition":"多人为做某事而聚在一起的行为。","pronunciation":["모임"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"不知道的某时。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]}],"audio":"/audio/d194683da5a1ec63645a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73258-2-5-2","ko":"매달 열흘이야. 이번 달 10일에 계주 집에서 계 모임을 해.","zh":"每月十号。这月十号在会首